# Agent Execution Protocol

## Feature Implementation
- Always break tasks into an explicit checklist before writing code.
- Ensure type-safety, handle zero/null edge cases, and keep diffs localized.
- Run tests or builds automatically before marking a subtask complete.

## Reverse Engineering & Auditing
- Map execution paths, hook points, and state transitions explicitly before proposing changes.
- Trace memory layout, data models, or external contract interfaces and summarize them in `docs/`.

## Code Review
- Ensure modified logic aligns with neighboring architectural patterns.
- Reject unhandled async paths, implicit type coercion, or missing error boundaries.